# Heroes of Abyssea (abyssea 179), the partial: a level 99 Warrior in Port Jeuno with A Journey Begins completed and the
# quest accepted (GMs). Each pair of its three maw quests completed with the third missing (An Ulcerous Uragnite
# missing, A Beaked Blusterer missing, A Man-eating Mite missing): the completion section needs all three, so Joachim
# offers nothing each time.
lists PortJeuno/Joachim/onTrigger PortJeuno/onEventFinish/341
char zone=PortJeuno pos=-51.344,0,-9.978 job=WAR lvl=99
quest Abyssea.AJourneyBegins completed
quest Abyssea.HeroesOfAbyssea accepted
quest Abyssea.ABeakedBlusterer completed
quest Abyssea.AManEatingMite completed
login
trigger Joachim                         # An Ulcerous Uragnite missing: nothing
finish-if-event
quest Abyssea.ABeakedBlusterer available
quest Abyssea.AnUlcerousUragnite completed
trigger Joachim                         # A Beaked Blusterer missing: nothing
finish-if-event
quest Abyssea.AManEatingMite available
quest Abyssea.ABeakedBlusterer completed
trigger Joachim                         # A Man-eating Mite missing: nothing
finish-if-event
